          en: 'Doflamingo seals all of Dressrosa inside a cage of strings that answers to no one but him, then names a hit list of everyone he wants dead to break it, [[usopp|Usopp]], to his own disbelief, at the very top. Citizens and marines alike find their own limbs turned against friends and strangers, forced puppets in a game only Doflamingo enjoys. From the palace plateau he watches the island tear itself apart below him and calls it, without irony, a chance for everyone to prove what they are really made of.',
